# A declared function can produce a value wherever an expression is accepted.

to double number
    return number times 2
.

answer is double 10
say answer

to combine first and second
    return first plus second
.

sum is combine 3 and 4
say sum

nested is double double 5
say nested

# Legacy statement-style capture remains supported.
double 5 make legacyAnswer
say legacyAnswer
